WEBVTT

01:43.080 --> 01:45.680
KEEP QUIET

01:45.760 --> 01:49.400
SURGICAL WARD

01:53.520 --> 01:54.400
Sir.

02:12.680 --> 02:13.600
Sir.

02:16.040 --> 02:17.280
What are you doing here?

02:17.840 --> 02:20.840
You're getting discharged today.
I came to help you pack.

02:22.600 --> 02:23.720
Come on.

02:30.360 --> 02:31.320
PARADOX THINKING
IN CRIMINAL INVESTIGATIONS

02:31.400 --> 02:32.280
BY RAN FANGXU

02:34.160 --> 02:35.680
Why are you reading that?

02:35.760 --> 02:37.600
Just brushing up.

02:40.240 --> 02:41.240
Hey.

02:42.400 --> 02:43.320
Give it back.

02:46.040 --> 02:48.640
I wrote that two years ago
when I didn't know any better.

02:48.720 --> 02:50.280
It's all just theory.

02:51.520 --> 02:53.200
That's what I used to think too.

02:53.280 --> 02:54.920
But now,

02:55.520 --> 02:59.120
your so-called theory
actually holds up in practice.

02:59.200 --> 03:00.040
It's helpful.

03:04.160 --> 03:05.680
By the way, sir,

03:05.760 --> 03:08.000
what are you planning to do
after you're discharged?

03:13.840 --> 03:16.640
Can I stay on
with the Criminal Department?

03:18.080 --> 03:19.360
Of course.

03:20.360 --> 03:21.920
You got injured on duty.

03:22.000 --> 03:24.200
The team will make room for you.

03:26.000 --> 03:27.000
Then I'll stay.

03:27.760 --> 03:28.680
Good.

03:38.640 --> 03:39.960
What about Xiaohe?

03:40.840 --> 03:42.640
I need to look after her,

03:42.720 --> 03:44.240
and I have cases to crack.

03:44.880 --> 03:46.680
Cases? What case?

03:48.320 --> 03:51.200
Do you really think Xu Meng is dead?

03:54.240 --> 03:57.280
I've been thinking. A case
that dragged on for five years,

03:57.360 --> 04:00.040
and suddenly it gets wrapped up
in three days. That's way too smooth.

04:00.640 --> 04:03.320
Could there be a possibility that Xu Meng

04:03.400 --> 04:06.040
got away from Wu Shanlong a long time ago,

04:06.120 --> 04:08.840
and he just left her shoes behind?

04:08.920 --> 04:09.880
That's possible.

04:10.960 --> 04:13.640
As long as we have
solid evidence and leads,

04:14.240 --> 04:16.760
I'll go to Director Zou
and ask to reopen the case.

04:17.480 --> 04:18.519
Director Zou?

04:18.600 --> 04:19.720
Why him?

04:19.800 --> 04:22.000
Shouldn't we report to Captain Feng?

04:23.600 --> 04:26.000
Captain Feng retired last week.

04:28.960 --> 04:30.360
So that means…

04:31.200 --> 04:32.440
You brat.

04:36.400 --> 04:37.680
Captain Ran.

04:38.680 --> 04:40.000
Come on. Don't do that.

04:40.920 --> 04:42.360
You,

04:42.440 --> 04:45.320
get back to work. Don't waste time here.

04:45.400 --> 04:47.520
-Go.
-About Xu Meng's case?

04:48.960 --> 04:50.120
No rush.

04:50.200 --> 04:51.040
I'll think it through some more.

04:53.520 --> 04:55.760
-I'm going then.
-Go on.

04:55.840 --> 04:57.280
Hurry.

05:13.800 --> 05:17.920
FOUR MONTHS LATER, EARLY WINTER

05:18.000 --> 05:19.960
The theft ring is hiding
in the urban village.

05:20.040 --> 05:21.840
If we lock it down,
we can take them all in one sweep.

05:21.920 --> 05:23.440
There are so few of us.

05:23.520 --> 05:24.640
How are we supposed to seal it off?

05:24.720 --> 05:25.840
What about the northeast corner?

05:25.920 --> 05:27.280
How do we block that? You tell me.

05:36.440 --> 05:37.760
Is the arrest plan ready?

05:37.840 --> 05:39.920
We are working it out.

05:40.440 --> 05:42.560
The urban-village area is complicated.

05:44.720 --> 05:45.760
Where's Ran Fangxu?

05:47.480 --> 05:48.720
He was here just now.

05:52.520 --> 05:54.880
Captain Ran. Captain Ran.

05:54.960 --> 05:55.840
Wake up.

05:57.760 --> 05:59.040
Captain Ran. Director Zou is here.

06:00.280 --> 06:01.120
Director Zou,

06:01.200 --> 06:03.480
I pulled an all-nighter last night.
I'm so tired. Can't keep my eyes open.

06:05.520 --> 06:06.520
I'm here.

06:10.720 --> 06:12.560
Get out. Go wake yourself up outside.

06:13.480 --> 06:14.280
Yes, sir.

06:17.800 --> 06:19.360
This group of thieves
stole 1.5 million in cash

06:19.440 --> 06:22.400
from the Railway Administration
and is hiding in the urban village.

06:22.480 --> 06:24.520
The tricky part is the northeast corner.

06:24.600 --> 06:27.720
In this corner, there are over
a dozen paths of all kinds

06:27.800 --> 06:30.040
and plenty of hidden openings like these.

06:31.040 --> 06:32.480
We've tried multiple plans,

06:32.560 --> 06:35.520
but still can't fully block
Luandongzi's escape routes.

06:42.960 --> 06:44.320
Director Zou,

06:44.400 --> 06:47.040
should we call in armed police for backup?

07:00.320 --> 07:01.160
Director Zou.

07:02.800 --> 07:04.520
Leave the northeast corner to me.

07:05.440 --> 07:08.600
-Problem solved!
-All good then!

07:08.680 --> 07:10.280
-That'd be great.
-Good then.

07:11.280 --> 07:13.520
If your captain is willing
to stake his life on it,

07:14.320 --> 07:16.240
-then it's settled.
-Wait.

07:16.320 --> 07:17.560
-Zhao Jie.
-Yes, sir.

07:18.080 --> 07:20.280
-Put that into the plan.
-Don't.

07:20.960 --> 07:22.040
Director Zou,

07:22.120 --> 07:24.240
I never said I'd stake my life.

07:25.960 --> 07:27.320
-Did he or not?
-He did.

07:29.840 --> 07:32.360
SOLIDARITY

07:42.080 --> 07:43.400
We're short one. Just waiting on you.

07:43.480 --> 07:44.520
Hurry up.

07:52.480 --> 07:53.760
Has Captain Ran
gone to the northeast corner?

07:53.840 --> 07:55.080
He has. Don't worry.

08:10.360 --> 08:12.840
So sorry. Sorry.

08:18.560 --> 08:19.280
Move.

08:20.320 --> 08:21.520
Stop!

08:23.560 --> 08:24.440
-Cut him off over there.
-Go.

08:25.720 --> 08:27.400
-Stop.
-Stop.

08:28.000 --> 08:29.120
-Don't run.
-Watch out.

08:29.200 --> 08:30.040
Don't run.

08:49.560 --> 08:51.320
Two of you, go around and box him in.

08:58.640 --> 09:00.640
No one is stopping me.

09:08.040 --> 09:09.800
He walked right into it. Easy.

09:09.880 --> 09:10.880
Don't scratch my car.

09:15.520 --> 09:16.200
POLICE

09:16.280 --> 09:17.120
Get out.

09:18.600 --> 09:19.960
Out of the car.

09:20.040 --> 09:21.120
Don't shoot.

09:21.200 --> 09:22.520
I surrender.

09:22.600 --> 09:24.320
-Take him!
-I surrender.

09:25.400 --> 09:26.160
Ow!

09:26.240 --> 09:27.240
Cuff him.

09:27.320 --> 09:29.000
-Easy.
-Don't move.

09:29.080 --> 09:30.360
Take him away.

09:31.880 --> 09:33.120
Officer,

09:33.200 --> 09:34.480
I have something to report.

09:34.560 --> 09:35.600
I can help.

09:35.680 --> 09:38.080
The property manager
of Yuanlongli, Qian Dajun.

09:38.160 --> 09:40.440
He's bad news.

09:40.520 --> 09:41.600
-Take him back for interrogation.
-Yes, sir.

09:41.680 --> 09:42.880
-Officer! Trust me!
-Move.

09:42.960 --> 09:44.240
Trust me!

09:44.320 --> 09:45.880
-Move.
-Trust me!

09:45.960 --> 09:47.000
I can help!

09:48.440 --> 09:49.720
Captain Ran,

09:49.800 --> 09:52.440
next time you have
something like this, call me in.

09:52.520 --> 09:55.240
I don't often get to play cop like this.

09:55.320 --> 09:56.680
-Thank you, Sun.
-Not at all.

09:56.760 --> 09:58.120
-Appreciate it, Captain Sun.
-Of course.

09:58.200 --> 09:59.480
We couldn't have
pulled this off without you.

09:59.560 --> 10:00.640
Come.

10:00.720 --> 10:02.560
-Good work.
-No problem.

10:04.080 --> 10:05.600
MR. ZHANG

10:08.920 --> 10:10.480
Hello, Mr. Zhang?

10:11.200 --> 10:12.240
I'm so sorry, Mr. Zhang.

10:12.320 --> 10:13.920
Please calm down. I'll handle it.

10:14.000 --> 10:15.000
I'll deal with it right away.

10:15.080 --> 10:21.400
NEIGHBORHOOD EAR CLEANING

10:32.360 --> 10:33.120
CANDESARTAN TABLETS

10:46.400 --> 10:48.960
Mister, are you from this neighborhood?

10:50.480 --> 10:51.640
No.

10:52.680 --> 10:54.320
You look familiar.

10:56.520 --> 10:58.200
Back in 1997, I came to ask about

10:59.240 --> 11:01.080
your brother and his daughter
who went missing.

11:05.640 --> 11:07.240
I remember now.

11:07.320 --> 11:09.080
You're that police officer.

11:09.880 --> 11:13.000
Officer, any news about my niece?

11:16.960 --> 11:19.040
It doesn't look good.

11:19.600 --> 11:22.360
That poor girl has had a hard life.

11:22.440 --> 11:25.920
She used to have someone
she was going to marry.

11:26.000 --> 11:27.240
He was from out of town.

11:27.320 --> 11:29.120
He came to Weiyang a few times.

11:29.200 --> 11:30.440
He's from a decent family.

11:31.200 --> 11:33.040
If they'd gotten married,

11:33.120 --> 11:35.680
things might've turned out differently.

11:36.600 --> 11:37.840
She had a boyfriend?

11:37.920 --> 11:39.040
Why didn't you mention that before?

11:39.120 --> 11:41.680
They lost touch a long time ago.

11:41.760 --> 11:43.200
My brother was to blame.

11:43.280 --> 11:45.280
He didn't approve of him
and wouldn't let them be together.

11:45.360 --> 11:47.920
He forced them apart.

11:50.160 --> 11:52.400
Do you remember his name?

11:52.480 --> 11:53.760
What's the name?

11:54.280 --> 11:55.640
It was something nice.

11:56.240 --> 11:58.040
What's his name again?

11:58.640 --> 12:01.240
Qiming. Wan Qiming.

12:02.040 --> 12:03.120
Wan Qiming.

12:04.360 --> 12:06.520
What did he look like?

12:08.120 --> 12:11.240
Wait. I have a photo of him.

12:11.320 --> 12:12.240
Let me show you.

12:22.400 --> 12:24.720
This one. This one here.
The one with glasses.

12:26.160 --> 12:27.240
This?

12:27.320 --> 12:28.480
The man with glasses.

12:29.640 --> 12:31.920
The person who hired you,
what's their name?

12:32.000 --> 12:33.280
What do they look like?

12:33.360 --> 12:34.400
A man.

12:35.120 --> 12:37.600
He looks about 25 or 26.

12:37.680 --> 12:39.320
Tall.

12:39.400 --> 12:40.840
Wears glasses.

12:40.920 --> 12:42.200
Side-parted hair.

12:42.280 --> 12:44.160
Looks well-mannered.

12:49.400 --> 12:52.000
USE WITH CARE, ECO-RECYCLE

12:53.760 --> 12:54.600
Let's do it now.

12:56.120 --> 12:57.000
Are you sure?

12:59.880 --> 13:01.600
Who the heck are you?

13:02.480 --> 13:04.360
Do you know who my boss is?

13:06.680 --> 13:07.720
Who?

13:08.520 --> 13:09.800
You.

13:09.880 --> 13:11.360
Get lost.

13:19.640 --> 13:20.720
Let's go home and have dumplings.

13:20.800 --> 13:21.960
You're home.

13:27.000 --> 13:28.160
My goodness.

13:30.040 --> 13:32.080
-Sir.
-Green hair. Panda eyes.

13:32.840 --> 13:34.480
Torn pants. A dog collar.

13:34.560 --> 13:37.600
I'm raising a kid, not some freak.

13:37.680 --> 13:39.680
He Yuanhang, what did you promise me?

13:39.760 --> 13:41.280
If I'd known, I would've gone
to the provincial capital with my mom.

13:42.640 --> 13:43.920
You think I don't keep my word?

13:44.000 --> 13:45.240
I used to just be your dad.

13:45.320 --> 13:47.640
Now I'm playing both parents.

13:47.720 --> 13:49.000
Look at you.

13:49.080 --> 13:50.840
Dye your hair today, tattoo tomorrow.

13:50.920 --> 13:52.240
What's next, drugs?

13:52.320 --> 13:53.920
You're a student, you know that?

13:54.000 --> 13:54.960
School is for idiots.

13:55.040 --> 13:56.120
I'm doing rock.

13:56.200 --> 13:57.480
That's real rock spirit.

14:03.440 --> 14:04.920
Rock spirit, my foot.

14:05.000 --> 14:06.840
More like rock nutcase.

14:08.080 --> 14:09.560
And she still has the nerve
to eat my dumplings?

14:16.920 --> 14:20.200
What's wrong with her?
Am I pushing her too hard?

14:25.160 --> 14:26.160
Take it easy.

14:26.760 --> 14:27.640
I'm not drinking.

14:29.600 --> 14:31.800
Teenagers are like this, right?

14:33.720 --> 14:35.000
Anyway,

14:35.520 --> 14:38.560
Xiaohe may be rebellious, but she's smart.

14:38.640 --> 14:42.000
She scored over 95 in every subject
on the mock exam.

14:44.280 --> 14:46.240
Her homeroom teacher told me.

14:47.200 --> 14:48.640
MR. ZHANG

14:50.120 --> 14:51.600
Hello, Mr. Zhang?

14:52.400 --> 14:54.440
Now the teacher doesn't even know
whether to praise her

14:54.520 --> 14:55.360
or scold her.

14:55.440 --> 14:57.080
He Xiaohe skipped school
five days this week.

14:57.160 --> 14:59.200
Her total score didn't even reach 95.

14:59.280 --> 15:00.960
I'm so sorry, Mr. Zhang.

15:01.480 --> 15:02.840
Please calm down. I'll handle it.

15:02.920 --> 15:03.760
I'll deal with it right away.

15:05.200 --> 15:07.680
Xiaohe is brain and brawn.

15:07.760 --> 15:11.280
She might turn out to be
a great criminal investigator.

15:16.440 --> 15:18.720
She's good for the physical side.

15:18.800 --> 15:20.240
I've trained her myself
since she was little.

15:20.320 --> 15:22.400
She's even better than you.

15:23.680 --> 15:25.000
But academically…

15:26.480 --> 15:27.840
Ninety-five in every subject?

15:28.760 --> 15:29.840
Yeah, 95 in every subject.

15:39.480 --> 15:40.440
Ninety-five in every subject…

15:40.520 --> 15:41.760
Sir.

15:43.200 --> 15:45.400
-Disability allowance for this month.
-I don't want it.

15:46.000 --> 15:47.960
The label doesn't feel right.
Taking it feels wrong.

15:48.040 --> 15:49.480
Disability allowance.

15:49.560 --> 15:51.240
It reminds me every month
that I'm disabled.

15:52.400 --> 15:54.240
When can I return to the team?

15:55.440 --> 15:57.840
You're not fully recovered yet.

15:58.360 --> 16:00.960
Besides, you haven't been idle.

16:01.560 --> 16:04.400
I know you've been looking into Xu Meng.

16:16.160 --> 16:17.960
I'm injured now.

16:18.920 --> 16:20.560
There's nothing else I can do.

16:20.640 --> 16:22.680
I might as well see this case through

16:23.680 --> 16:25.720
and give myself some closure.

16:30.800 --> 16:32.360
The Yuanlongli case

16:32.880 --> 16:34.040
feels like it's done,

16:34.920 --> 16:36.520
but not really.

16:38.240 --> 16:40.480
Feels like something's
still hanging over it.

16:42.440 --> 16:44.600
That's why I want to dig deeper.

16:44.680 --> 16:47.480
I found out Xu Meng had a boyfriend

16:47.560 --> 16:49.360
named Wan Qiming.

16:50.640 --> 16:53.240
This man is suspicious.

16:53.320 --> 16:55.520
I'm planning to head out of town
and meet him.

16:56.200 --> 16:59.000
-Out of town?
-You don't have to come with me.

16:59.760 --> 17:02.520
You're the captain.
You have plenty on your plate.

17:02.600 --> 17:05.880
If I find anything, I'll keep you posted.

17:18.880 --> 17:20.000
Captain,

17:20.079 --> 17:23.000
this is Luandongzi's statement.
Take a look.

17:23.079 --> 17:24.680
-Did he talk?
-He did.

17:25.520 --> 17:26.400
Not just that,

17:27.560 --> 17:29.200
he took all the blame.

17:29.280 --> 17:30.760
He didn't mention anything
about his accomplices.

17:32.920 --> 17:34.560
We worked this hard to bring him in.

17:34.640 --> 17:37.640
If he keeps his mouth shut,
we'll never get the others.

17:49.080 --> 17:49.920
The cop takes out a knife.

17:53.920 --> 17:54.960
You scared me.

17:58.080 --> 17:58.960
Captain Ran.

18:20.520 --> 18:22.000
I heard you confessed to everything.

18:22.960 --> 18:24.360
Captain Ran,

18:24.440 --> 18:27.800
well, I like coming clean. Come clean.

18:35.000 --> 18:37.800
You took 1.5 million in cash
from the Railway Administration

18:39.320 --> 18:40.680
all alone?

18:40.760 --> 18:43.640
That's right.
I brought it out all by myself.

18:45.040 --> 18:47.080
The compound is huge.

18:47.160 --> 18:51.320
Four security teams.
Patrols every five minutes.

18:51.400 --> 18:54.640
How did you get out
carrying all that cash?

18:56.080 --> 18:57.680
I just saw my chance and took it.

18:57.760 --> 19:00.160
There happened to be
a heavy downpour that day.

19:00.240 --> 19:01.680
It really covered for me.

19:01.760 --> 19:03.320
Goodness.

19:06.360 --> 19:08.080
Don't get worked up.

19:09.560 --> 19:12.680
Yesterday, you shouted that you wanted
to report Qian Dajun from Yuanlongli.

19:12.760 --> 19:13.920
What's that about?

19:14.480 --> 19:16.440
I was talking nonsense.

19:16.520 --> 19:18.920
You know my line of work.

19:19.000 --> 19:20.160
High pressure.

19:20.240 --> 19:23.440
Sometimes you have to let it out.

19:29.160 --> 19:31.120
Come. Let's go out.

19:34.280 --> 19:35.360
INTERROGATION ROOM

19:38.640 --> 19:39.920
Let your pressure out.

19:40.000 --> 19:41.000
Take him out.

19:44.400 --> 19:46.240
Didn't you hear? Let my pressure out.

19:47.320 --> 19:48.720
Jeez. Let your pressure out?

19:49.520 --> 19:51.440
Cops can't hit just anyone.

19:52.520 --> 19:53.440
Hands.

20:00.600 --> 20:01.440
Captain Ran.

20:07.160 --> 20:08.760
Let's say you're telling the truth.

20:08.840 --> 20:10.760
The distance from
the Railway Administration building

20:10.840 --> 20:13.080
to the back gate is 1,400 meters.

20:13.800 --> 20:15.920
The perimeter of this field is 86 meters.

20:16.520 --> 20:19.480
Divide 1,400 by 86, it's about 16 laps.

20:19.560 --> 20:22.480
1.5 million in cash is under 20 kilograms.

20:23.240 --> 20:25.240
This bag of rice is 15 kilograms.

20:25.760 --> 20:27.280
Here.

20:27.360 --> 20:29.800
Carry it. Run 15 laps.

20:30.640 --> 20:34.280
I'll time you. Let's see if you can
dodge patrols within five minutes.

20:34.360 --> 20:36.320
-Wait.
-Come. I'll keep time.

20:36.840 --> 20:38.120
Ready.

20:38.200 --> 20:39.520
-We'll run with you.
-Ready.

20:39.600 --> 20:41.520
-Listen to me.
-Run.

20:43.480 --> 20:45.080
-Faster.
-Run.

20:45.160 --> 20:46.880
-Pick it up.
-Move it.

20:46.960 --> 20:48.240
-Speed up.
-Faster.

20:48.320 --> 20:50.040
-Speed up.
-Faster.

20:51.120 --> 20:53.000
Faster.

20:53.080 --> 20:54.960
Keep going.

20:55.040 --> 20:56.720
Speed up.

20:56.800 --> 20:58.000
-Faster.
-Thank you.

21:08.240 --> 21:10.400
-One minute and 30 seconds.
-Not even two minutes yet.

21:10.480 --> 21:11.960
Security hasn't come around.

21:12.040 --> 21:13.080
Keep running.

21:13.160 --> 21:14.760
-As fast as you can.
-Get up.

21:16.600 --> 21:17.800
I'll talk.

21:17.880 --> 21:18.960
I'll tell you everything.

21:19.560 --> 21:20.720
Not just me,

21:21.240 --> 21:22.240
there were three others.

21:22.840 --> 21:25.680
Including me, there were four in total.

21:26.360 --> 21:27.600
Here. Wipe your face.

21:29.320 --> 21:30.640
Thank you.

21:34.920 --> 21:38.160
-Tell me about Qian Dajun.
-Right.

21:39.120 --> 21:42.520
There's an underground garage
in Yuanlongli, you know?

21:43.440 --> 21:45.880
That money grabber has a stash down there.

21:45.960 --> 21:48.120
A lot of valuables.

21:52.680 --> 21:53.840
Officer Ran,

21:54.680 --> 21:56.760
what are you doing
in the underground garage?

21:56.840 --> 21:58.000
I saw it with my own eyes.

21:58.080 --> 21:59.720
He carried a safe inside.

21:59.800 --> 22:01.160
When he came out,

22:01.680 --> 22:03.520
the safe was gone.

22:04.120 --> 22:06.120
I believe something's off for sure.

22:17.640 --> 22:18.480
Mr. Qian,

22:19.000 --> 22:21.000
aren't you opening up slots
for rental next month?

22:21.640 --> 22:24.080
Could you maybe squeeze us in early?

22:24.160 --> 22:27.400
MANAGER'S OFFICE

22:27.480 --> 22:28.080
CHUNGHWA CIGARETTE

22:34.760 --> 22:36.960
Officer Ran. How may I help?

22:38.640 --> 22:40.360
Carry on. I'll wait outside.

22:41.040 --> 22:42.280
Alright.

22:44.760 --> 22:45.600
What do you mean?

22:46.120 --> 22:48.480
Cut the line? That's not happening.

22:48.560 --> 22:50.640
The management team follows the rules.

22:51.160 --> 22:52.520
Take it away. Everything.

22:52.600 --> 22:54.000
-Mr. Qian.
-Remember this.

22:54.080 --> 22:56.360
Handle everything by the book.
Open and transparent.

22:56.440 --> 22:57.880
No backdoor dealings.

22:58.400 --> 23:00.320
-Got it.
-Officer Ran.

23:00.400 --> 23:01.920
ROAD WORK AHEAD, STAY SAFE

23:07.360 --> 23:08.480
Officer Ran.

23:09.080 --> 23:09.960
Look,

23:11.360 --> 23:14.320
there's nothing here. Just consumables.

23:23.280 --> 23:25.320
Really. It's nothing.

23:25.920 --> 23:27.120
All junk.

23:33.160 --> 23:35.000
Officer Ran, these are just empty boxes.

23:35.080 --> 23:36.360
Just…

23:47.800 --> 23:48.920
Open it.

23:52.160 --> 23:53.880
It's been here too long.

23:53.960 --> 23:55.240
I forgot the passcode.

23:56.960 --> 23:57.800
Forgot?

24:00.560 --> 24:02.280
Then you and the boxes can come with me.

24:03.440 --> 24:04.880
I remember. I remember.

24:04.960 --> 24:05.800
I remember now.

24:30.200 --> 24:31.240
Where's the thing?

24:32.800 --> 24:33.640
What thing?

24:36.240 --> 24:40.240
Qian Dajun, someone reported you
for embezzling public assets.

24:40.320 --> 24:42.520
Officer Ran, I'm innocent.

24:42.600 --> 24:45.160
These… These are all
discarded supplies and consumables

24:45.240 --> 24:46.600
from the property office.

24:46.680 --> 24:49.280
I just wanted to sell them off
for a little cash.

24:58.840 --> 25:00.200
Mr. Qian,

25:00.800 --> 25:02.600
a word to the wise.

25:02.680 --> 25:04.600
Taking advantage can cost you big.

25:04.680 --> 25:06.120
Yes. Right.

25:06.200 --> 25:08.520
Don't worry. I'll make
all this disappear. Right away.

26:25.400 --> 26:27.360
-Hello.
-Hello.

26:27.880 --> 26:29.040
This man with glasses.

26:29.120 --> 26:30.800
Is he a photographer here?

26:30.880 --> 26:32.400
His style is unique.

26:33.040 --> 26:35.120
He's not just the photographer,
he owns this place.

26:35.200 --> 26:36.160
I see.

26:37.440 --> 26:38.440
Is he a local?

26:38.520 --> 26:41.520
Why are so many of his photos
taken by the sea?

26:41.600 --> 26:43.560
He used to work in Guangdong.

26:43.640 --> 26:45.560
Only came back last year
to open this place.

26:48.080 --> 26:49.240
This one.

26:50.240 --> 26:51.680
Guangdong's phone number.

26:56.520 --> 26:58.880
Well. I'm from a magazine.

26:58.960 --> 27:01.120
I really like his style.

27:01.200 --> 27:03.960
Could I talk to him
about a possible collaboration?

27:04.040 --> 27:06.400
Bad timing. He's out of town on a shoot.

27:06.480 --> 27:07.640
I see.

27:08.200 --> 27:09.040
When will he be back?

27:09.840 --> 27:11.120
Hard to say.

27:12.920 --> 27:15.240
If you need this,
you can try calling his mobile.

27:15.320 --> 27:17.840
But when he's out on field trips,
he usually keeps his phone off.

27:17.920 --> 27:19.240
Alright. Thank you.

27:19.760 --> 27:20.960
WAN QIMING'S BUSINESS CARD

27:55.160 --> 27:56.040
Sorry.

27:56.120 --> 27:57.520
This is Mr. Wan's private workspace.

27:57.600 --> 27:59.200
-Not open to visitors.
-Right.

27:59.280 --> 28:00.880
It does look quite unique inside.

28:00.960 --> 28:02.600
Mr. Wan has a wide range of interests.

28:02.680 --> 28:06.360
He collects antique knives.
He loves making specimens.

28:09.280 --> 28:10.920
Where did he go for his field trip?

28:17.040 --> 28:20.920
CAROUSEL'S DEAD HEAT

28:41.480 --> 28:43.680
SPINNING CAROUSEL

28:48.800 --> 28:49.680
Xiaohe.

28:49.760 --> 28:52.320
-Xiaohe is here.
-Look who's here.

28:52.400 --> 28:54.160
-Say hi.
-Officer Ran, hello.

28:54.960 --> 28:56.320
Hello, guys.

28:57.040 --> 28:59.040
Same as usual.
I'll pick you up in two hours.

28:59.960 --> 29:01.000
You're not staying to watch the rehearsal?

29:01.600 --> 29:04.600
I have plans. Record it.
I'll listen later at home.

29:06.400 --> 29:09.560
You guys go ahead. Wait.

29:10.400 --> 29:12.960
Uncle Ran, you're going on a date, right?

29:13.040 --> 29:14.960
I saw you texting in the car just now.

29:15.040 --> 29:16.520
You were blushing.

29:19.160 --> 29:21.560
You don't show up empty-handed for a date.

29:27.880 --> 29:28.840
Ms. Qiao will like it.

29:29.760 --> 29:31.320
It's not that.

29:31.400 --> 29:33.400
Uncle Ran, trust me.

29:33.480 --> 29:36.560
I've watched way more dramas
than cases you've worked on.

29:36.640 --> 29:37.480
Take it.

29:38.360 --> 29:39.640
Take it.

30:07.200 --> 30:08.440
Welcome.

30:15.120 --> 30:16.160
Have you been waiting long?

30:17.800 --> 30:18.920
I just got here.

30:28.520 --> 30:31.200
I picked this cake up on the way just now.

30:31.280 --> 30:32.480
It's for you.

30:36.000 --> 30:37.240
Thank you.

30:48.120 --> 30:49.480
This is

30:50.040 --> 30:51.560
for me?

30:52.640 --> 30:53.480
Yes.

30:56.720 --> 30:57.600
It's from Xiaohe.

30:58.880 --> 31:00.640
I just brought it over.

31:09.880 --> 31:10.920
Thank you.

31:27.680 --> 31:28.640
Freedom, freedom

31:28.720 --> 31:31.040
It's burning

31:31.120 --> 31:34.360
Close your eyes, get some rest

31:34.440 --> 31:35.280
Run, run

31:37.400 --> 31:38.960
What the heck is this?

31:39.040 --> 31:40.360
Who did this?

31:40.440 --> 31:41.560
Come out here.

31:41.640 --> 31:43.880
-Who turned on the light? Come out here.
-Come out!

31:48.160 --> 31:49.040
Dad.

31:49.120 --> 31:50.600
Why are you back?

31:52.600 --> 31:54.200
My dear son,

31:54.760 --> 31:56.240
you really didn't disappoint me.

31:56.320 --> 31:57.360
Dad, let me explain.

31:57.440 --> 31:58.520
Explain it to my belt.

31:58.600 --> 32:00.640
-Stand right there! Stand right there!
-Dad.

32:00.720 --> 32:01.840
-I was wrong.
-Stop!

32:01.920 --> 32:03.160
-You're still running?
-Run.

32:03.240 --> 32:04.120
Don't run.

32:04.680 --> 32:06.560
Stand right there. Don't run!

32:07.560 --> 32:08.800
Run.

32:11.480 --> 32:13.480
Not this way. The door's locked. Go.

32:17.400 --> 32:18.120
Why are you running?

32:20.160 --> 32:21.320
Where's the other girl?

32:44.280 --> 32:45.360
Your guitar looks cool.

32:46.920 --> 32:49.600
Mister, where did you get it?

32:49.680 --> 32:51.000
You can't buy this anywhere.

33:01.880 --> 33:04.760
The summer solstice wind
Still blows at dusk

33:06.120 --> 33:08.360
It passes the moon

33:08.440 --> 33:10.920
Tracing the brows

33:12.880 --> 33:15.920
The world under the moon is bustling

33:17.120 --> 33:19.160
Yet I have no idea

33:19.240 --> 33:21.320
Where I should go

33:23.920 --> 33:26.360
Oh, youth

33:26.440 --> 33:29.160
So dazzling, so vast

33:29.240 --> 33:31.800
Dreams fill a young heart

33:31.880 --> 33:36.800
Yet they're beyond reach

33:45.960 --> 33:47.960
Teach me that.
I'll take you as my teacher.

33:49.080 --> 33:52.360
I'm leaving Weiyang tomorrow
for another city.

33:52.960 --> 33:55.600
Busking? I'll go with you.

33:55.680 --> 33:57.440
That's one man's adventure.

34:00.240 --> 34:01.280
Girl,

34:01.800 --> 34:03.520
if you really want to learn,

34:03.600 --> 34:04.520
go to Beijing.

34:04.600 --> 34:06.520
That's where rock started in China.

34:10.719 --> 34:11.920
Beijing?

34:16.320 --> 34:18.199
I'm planning to move next week

34:18.280 --> 34:20.719
to somewhere closer to work.

34:20.800 --> 34:22.400
I'm sharing a place with others.

34:26.880 --> 34:28.080
Don't rush.

34:28.159 --> 34:30.480
The unit just assigned me an apartment.

34:30.560 --> 34:33.840
I'm alone and used to the dorm.
I don't need it.

34:33.920 --> 34:36.239
If you don't mind, you can move in.

34:36.880 --> 34:38.639
I can't do that.

34:38.719 --> 34:40.600
It's assigned to you. It's not appropriate

34:40.679 --> 34:42.880
-for me to move in.
-It's fine.

34:42.960 --> 34:44.400
You've been living alone.

34:44.480 --> 34:47.120
You won't get used to sharing.

34:49.159 --> 34:50.840
Thank you, Ran.

34:50.920 --> 34:51.960
But no.

34:56.920 --> 34:58.320
Honestly,

34:58.920 --> 35:00.440
as long as there's no ghost,

35:01.280 --> 35:03.080
a little discomfort

35:03.720 --> 35:05.240
doesn't matter.

35:12.360 --> 35:15.760
That old man gave me food,

35:16.680 --> 35:17.680
money,

35:19.000 --> 35:20.640
and a place to stay.

35:22.440 --> 35:23.560
But

35:27.520 --> 35:29.560
he never gave me dignity.

35:37.640 --> 35:39.360
He was weak and afraid of light.

35:40.200 --> 35:43.320
Not a single ray of sunlight
was allowed inside.

35:44.920 --> 35:46.360
You trying to burn me?

35:52.280 --> 35:53.280
Back then,

35:55.360 --> 35:57.600
I never slept well

35:59.000 --> 36:00.840
or had a proper meal.

36:06.640 --> 36:07.800
Come here.

36:12.040 --> 36:13.200
Faster.

36:15.440 --> 36:16.720
Wipe it.

36:27.160 --> 36:28.280
You trollop.

36:35.960 --> 36:37.000
Did you try to put me to sleep?

36:37.800 --> 36:39.400
Did you? Did you?

36:39.480 --> 36:40.840
-You want me…
-No!

36:40.920 --> 36:42.280
asleep all the time?

36:42.360 --> 36:43.200
Right?

36:51.720 --> 36:53.520
He treated you like that.

36:54.040 --> 36:56.000
Why did you stay and take care of him?

36:57.280 --> 37:00.800
He had a bad temper
and drove off every caretaker.

37:00.880 --> 37:02.560
No one else would take the job.

37:03.080 --> 37:05.680
So the pay was high.

37:06.600 --> 37:08.840
My mom had just passed.

37:09.440 --> 37:11.720
I was buried in debt.

37:12.320 --> 37:15.680
I couldn't find anything that paid better.

37:22.040 --> 37:23.160
Qiao.

37:24.040 --> 37:26.240
You were miserable at Yuanlongli.

37:26.840 --> 37:27.920
After he died,

37:28.600 --> 37:29.960
why didn't you move out?

37:31.000 --> 37:32.960
His son's overseas.

37:33.040 --> 37:35.400
He asked me to watch the place,

37:35.480 --> 37:36.720
and it's rent-free.

37:37.320 --> 37:39.560
But he's coming back soon.

37:41.480 --> 37:44.280
Ran, I'm not trying to take advantage.

37:44.880 --> 37:46.520
I've wanted to move out for a while.

37:47.360 --> 37:48.240
It's just…

37:56.240 --> 37:59.000
I thought maybe

37:59.800 --> 38:03.200
I'd run into you again if I stayed there.

38:11.120 --> 38:13.040
Qiao, I…

38:15.800 --> 38:18.280
Ran, don't be nervous.

38:19.840 --> 38:21.680
I know I'm not good enough for you.

38:21.760 --> 38:23.680
I… No.

38:25.440 --> 38:27.160
That's not what I meant.

38:28.720 --> 38:31.560
Saying this out loud

38:32.440 --> 38:34.200
makes me feel better.

38:44.680 --> 38:50.200
YUNSHAN ZIZHU RESTAURANT

38:58.080 --> 39:00.560
It's cold out here. I can give you a ride.

39:00.640 --> 39:01.880
No need.

39:01.960 --> 39:04.560
The office is around here. I'll just walk.

39:05.080 --> 39:06.360
You should get back to work.

39:09.480 --> 39:10.800
Hey.

39:12.640 --> 39:14.480
-Are you alright?
-I'm fine.

39:16.480 --> 39:18.600
It's okay. You don't
have to keep the flower.

39:19.720 --> 39:20.560
No.

39:21.800 --> 39:23.600
You gave it to me.

39:23.680 --> 39:25.000
I won't let it get dirty.

40:12.720 --> 40:13.680
Step back a bit.

40:13.760 --> 40:14.920
The ambulance is coming.

40:15.000 --> 40:16.240
Make way.

40:20.640 --> 40:21.760
Back up.

40:24.880 --> 40:26.480
Back up.

40:29.200 --> 40:31.480
Look. A kid died in the fire.

40:31.560 --> 40:32.800
Choked on the smoke. Didn't make it out.

40:33.760 --> 40:35.640
Make way. Make way.

40:35.720 --> 40:37.080
Make way. Ran Fangxu from Nanshan Branch.

40:38.320 --> 40:39.320
AMBULANCE
